TEST-FIRST. The failing test is the row filter, because the key walk passes without it:

```go
// THE ENVELOPE FILTERS ROWS AS WELL AS KEYS, AND A KEY-SET WALK CANNOT SEE
// THIS. Every key in the document below is on the allowlist; the defect is
// WHICH ROWS are there. A place the traveller has never been to, and a place
